      "excerptEn": "Between cafes and trams, an unfinished correspondence crosses decades and finally finds someone who was ready to read it.",
      "excerptEs": "Entre cafés y tranvías, una correspondencia inacabada atraviesa décadas y encuentra, finalmente, a quien estaba listo para leerla.",
